---
name: dark-mode
inputs:
  - path: ./docs/dark-mode-spec.md
    kind: documentation
---

Add a dark-mode theme to the storefront, spanning the backend
(omnia-backend) and the mobile shells (vectis-mobile). Users pick a
theme in the mobile app's settings screen; the choice persists to the
backend so it survives logouts and stays consistent across devices.

The boundary between the two projects is a small HTTP contract for the
per-user theme-preference endpoints (`GET/PUT /v1/users/me/theme`).
The contract change lands first; the two implementation changes depend
on it.

Documentation: ./docs/dark-mode-spec.md.
